      "title": "SG-RIFE settings",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## SG-RIFE interpolation\n\n- Default interpolation: **3x**, `scale=1.0`, TTA enabled.\n- Supported multipliers: **2x through 8x**, including **3x and 5x**.\n- Automatic FPS uses source FPS multiplied by the interpolation value.\n- Enable **Use manual final FPS** to select an exact output rate instead.\n- Keep `include_last` enabled for a complete video.\n- `fp32` matches the reference pipeline; try `bf16` after validating output quality."
      ],
